    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d425">

                <pb facs="0530" n="414" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg414"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 342.112Sm6/—.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Vice Consul Curtis</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 28, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering yours. Take charge of body of Smith and notify relatives. Give every
                    possible care to Dorsch, the wounded man. Get statement from Dorsch and any
                    other persons knowing the facts; also statement from private who did the
                    shooting and report fully.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
